.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt SCAN_LONGN 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm scan_longn
.Nd parse a signed long integer from a bounded string
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In scan.h
.Ft size_t
.Fn scan_longn "const char *src" "size_t n" "long *dest"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn scan_longn
function parses a signed long integer from the buffer
.Fa src
of at most
.Fa n
bytes, storing the resulting value in
.Fa dest .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns the number of bytes consumed, or 0 if no valid integer could be parsed.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr scan_xlongn 3